/* FAQ, recherche, mise à jour (1.0.19) */
"Getting started" = "Getting started";
"Your Duo" = "Your Duo";
"Purchase and privacy" = "Purchase and privacy";
"Questions and answers" = "Questions and answers";
"The questions people ask most" = "The questions people ask most";
"Search a setting or a question" = "Search a setting or a question";
"No result" = "No result";
"How do I add Foldboard to my keyboards?" = "How do I add Foldboard to my keyboards?";
"On the home screen, tap **Add Foldboard to your keyboards**: Settings opens on Foldboard’s page. Tap **Keyboards** and turn on Foldboard. Then, in any app, hold the globe key under the keyboard and pick Foldboard." = "On the home screen, tap **Add Foldboard to your keyboards**: Settings opens on Foldboard’s page. Tap **Keyboards** and turn on Foldboard. Then, in any app, hold the globe key under the keyboard and pick Foldboard.";
"Why does Foldboard ask for Full Access?" = "Why does Foldboard ask for Full Access?";
"Only for vibrations, typing sounds, the clipboard and to share your settings between the app and the keyboard. The keyboard has no internet access: nothing you type leaves your iPhone." = "Only for vibrations, typing sounds, the clipboard and to share your settings between the app and the keyboard. The keyboard has no internet access: nothing you type leaves your iPhone.";
"Why does Apple’s keyboard sometimes show up instead?" = "Why does Apple’s keyboard sometimes show up instead?";
"iOS always uses its own keyboard for passwords and phone numbers, and some apps (banks, for example) don’t allow other keyboards. Foldboard comes back on its own in the next field. If it switches while you are typing, update Foldboard: recent versions use much less memory." = "iOS always uses its own keyboard for passwords and phone numbers, and some apps (banks, for example) don’t allow other keyboards. Foldboard comes back on its own in the next field. If it switches while you are typing, update Foldboard: recent versions use much less memory.";
"Can I dictate with Foldboard?" = "Can I dictate with Foldboard?";
"iOS doesn’t let keyboards from other apps use the microphone. To dictate, hold the globe key, pick Apple’s keyboard, dictate, then switch back to Foldboard the same way." = "iOS doesn’t let keyboards from other apps use the microphone. To dictate, hold the globe key, pick Apple’s keyboard, dictate, then switch back to Foldboard the same way.";
"How do I move the cursor?" = "How do I move the cursor?";
"How does slide to type work?" = "How does slide to type work?";
"Slide your thumb from letter to letter without lifting it: the word appears when you lift. If it’s not the right one, the other words are in the suggestion bar. Turn it on or off in **Typing**." = "Slide your thumb from letter to letter without lifting it: the word appears when you lift. If it’s not the right one, the other words are in the suggestion bar. Turn it on or off in **Typing**.";
"How do I undo an autocorrection?" = "How do I undo an autocorrection?";
"Tap delete right after the correction: your word comes back as you typed it, and Foldboard leaves it alone." = "Tap delete right after the correction: your word comes back as you typed it, and Foldboard leaves it alone.";
"How do I get emoji?" = "How do I get emoji?";
"Tap the emoji key, or just type a word like “love”, “pizza” or “merci”: an emoji shows up in the suggestion bar. You can turn this off in **Typing**." = "Tap the emoji key, or just type a word like “love”, “pizza” or “merci”: an emoji shows up in the suggestion bar. You can turn this off in **Typing**.";
"How do I paste?" = "How do I paste?";
"When you copy something, a Paste button shows up in the suggestion bar. Turn on **Save everything I copy** in **Typing** to find what you copied later with the clipboard button above the keys (it needs Full Access)." = "When you copy something, a Paste button shows up in the suggestion bar. Turn on **Save everything I copy** in **Typing** to find what you copied later with the clipboard button above the keys (it needs Full Access).";
"Which languages and layouts?" = "Which languages and layouts?";
"Layouts: AZERTY, QWERTY, QWERTZ, Spanish and Swedish (**Position and size › Layout**). Suggestions and autocorrect are made for French and English." = "Layouts: AZERTY, QWERTY, QWERTZ, Spanish and Swedish (**Position and size › Layout**). Suggestions and autocorrect are made for French and English.";
"How does the keyboard know which hand I’m using?" = "How does the keyboard know which hand I’m using?";
"Foldboard looks at how you hold your Duo and where your thumbs tap, and learns your habits. If it picks the wrong side, tap ⇆ above the keys: it moves and remembers. **Teach your thumbs** (30 seconds) helps it learn faster. Everything stays on your iPhone." = "Foldboard looks at how you hold your Duo and where your thumbs tap, and learns your habits. If it picks the wrong side, tap ⇆ above the keys: it moves and remembers. **Teach your thumbs** (30 seconds) helps it learn faster. Everything stays on your iPhone.";
"How do I type with both hands?" = "How do I type with both hands?";
"Tap the middle button above the keys: the keyboard goes full width. On the open Duo, the ••• button lets you choose full width, follows your hand or split keyboard. Foldboard remembers your choice for each screen." = "Tap the middle button above the keys: the keyboard goes full width. On the open Duo, the ••• button lets you choose full width, follows your hand or split keyboard. Foldboard remembers your choice for each screen.";
"How do I make the keys bigger or smaller?" = "How do I make the keys bigger or smaller?";
"Tap the sliders button above the keys and drag the keyboard, or go to **Position and size** in the app. **Reset size to default** brings back the original size." = "Tap the sliders button above the keys and drag the keyboard, or go to **Position and size** in the app. **Reset size to default** brings back the original size.";
"Why are there empty bands on the sides in landscape?" = "Why are there empty bands on the sides in landscape?";
"In landscape, iOS gives keyboards from other apps only the space between the rounded corners and the camera. Foldboard fills all the space it gets: the bands on the sides are kept by iOS." = "In landscape, iOS gives keyboards from other apps only the space between the rounded corners and the camera. Foldboard fills all the space it gets: the bands on the sides are kept by iOS.";
"How much does Foldboard cost?" = "How much does Foldboard cost?";
"You can try everything free for 3 days. Then Foldboard Pro is a one-time purchase, with no subscription. Without Pro, the keyboard keeps working with the basics." = "You can try everything free for 3 days. Then Foldboard Pro is a one-time purchase, with no subscription. Without Pro, the keyboard keeps working with the basics.";
"I changed iPhone. How do I get Pro back?" = "I changed iPhone. How do I get Pro back?";
"Open **Foldboard Pro** and tap **Restore purchases**, with the same Apple account." = "Open **Foldboard Pro** and tap **Restore purchases**, with the same Apple account.";
"Does Foldboard read what I type?" = "Does Foldboard read what I type?";
"No. The keyboard has no internet access, and Foldboard has no account and no ads. What it learns (your words, how you hold your Duo) stays on your iPhone." = "No. The keyboard has no internet access, and Foldboard has no account and no ads. What it learns (your words, how you hold your Duo) stays on your iPhone.";
